# Diluc Furina Xilonen Xianyun. ~23s Rot. Diluc Vape plunge. 2E Xilonen, with Xilonen attempting to Scroll Pyro during Diluc's burst. Uniform 1/6s midair wait for plunges to reduce incidence of overtaking Hydro aura; plunging as fast as possible severely compromises vape consistency. ~75% plunges Vaped. 50% Collisions.

# Team - Options listed by DPS
diluc char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
diluc add weapon="serpent" refine=1 lvl=90/90 +params=[stacks=5];
#diluc add weapon="rainslasher" refine=3 lvl=90/90;
diluc add set="cw" count=4;
#diluc add set="longnightsoath" count=4;
#diluc add set="mh" count=4;
diluc add stats hp=4780 atk=311 em=187 pyro%=0.466 cd=0.622; #main
diluc add stats def%=0.124 def=39.36 hp=507.88 hp%=0.0992 atk=33.08 atk%=0.0992 er=0.1102 em=79.28 cr=0.3972 cd=0.662; # Other
#diluc add stats hp=4780 atk=311 em=187 pyro%=0.466 cd=0.622; #main
